' Held keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`). On the world
' map S held half a second pans the camera 34 pixels down (`UpdateCameraPan`,
' seventy a second, the release on the 31st frame; the log says where it ends).
' In Paradise Camp the right arrow held 480 ms walks the leader 60 pixels
' (`ManualPath`, the port's two
' pixels a frame for thirty frames): the two saves have him at 64,160 and
' then 124,160.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
holdkey s 500            ' the map pans down
wait 40
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
save                     ' where he stands
holdkey right 480        ' he walks right
wait 40
save                     ' sixty pixels on
quit
